{
  "declaredLength": 2076,
  "decoding": "confirmed-per-slot-XOR-rotate3-index-seed",
  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "어서 오세요,\n리스토란테 이류입니다.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 220,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5B4C11C0020C624C138C694002C000AB9ACC2A4D1A0B780D14C0020C774B958C785B2C8B2E4002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "풀코스에\n도전하시겠습니까?<U+0010><U+0002>봊\nText_icon1",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 264,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D480CF54C2A4C5D0000AB3C4C804D558C2DCACA0C2B5B2C8AE4C003F00100002BD0A000A0054006500780074005F00690063006F006E00310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "오빠가 쏜다!\n맛있는 식사를 즐기라고",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 324,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C624BE60AC000020C3DCB2E40021000AB9DBC788B2940020C2DDC0ACB97C0020C990AE30B77CACE00000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "내가 즐기고 싶은 건\n식사라는 이름의 포켓몬 승부야",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 368,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B0B4AC000020C990AE30ACE00020C2F6C7400020AC74000AC2DDC0ACB77CB2940020C774B984C7580020D3ECCF13BAAC0020C2B9BD80C57C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "마음은 이해한다만\n냄새가 날 수도 있잖니",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 428,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B9C8C74CC7400020C774D574D55CB2E4B9CC000AB0C4C0C8AC000020B0A00020C218B3C40020C788C796B2C80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "포켓몬이랑 같이 먹고 싶어!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 476,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D3ECCF13BAACC774B7910020AC19C7740020BA39ACE00020C2F6C5B400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "오늘의 프로마주는\n180년 숙성 얼티메이트 하드 치즈.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n씹으면 코가 비틀어질 정도로\n독특한 냄새를 풍기는 블루치즈.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n암컷 아보크의 맹독을 사용한\n워시 치즈군요.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 508,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 96
    },
    {
      "displayText": "디저트는 늘 먹던 대로...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n메호키열매&복분열매의 소르베\n허브향이 풍부한 무스 곁들임으로 하죠.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 700,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B514C800D2B8B2940020B2980020BA39B3580020B300B85C002E002E002E00100001BE01000ABA54D638D0A4C5F4B9E40026BCF5BD84C5F4B9E4C7580020C18CB974BCA0000AD5C8BE0CD5A5C7740020D48DBD80D55C0020BB34C2A40020ACC1B4E4C784C73CB85C0020D558C8E0002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 57
    },
    {
      "displayText": "맛은 당연하고...\n양도 만족도가 높을 것 같네요.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 816,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B9DBC7400020B2F9C5F0D558ACE0002E002E002E000AC591B3C40020B9CCC871B3C4AC000020B192C7440020AC830020AC19B124C694002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "다 먹지 못하면 포장해 가서\n포켓몬들에게 나눠 줘야겠네요.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 876,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B2E40020BA39C9C00020BABBD558BA740020D3ECC7A5D5740020AC00C11C000AD3ECCF13BAACB4E4C5D0AC8C0020B098B2200020C918C57CACA0B124C694002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "아빠...\n사실은 부자인 거 아니야?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 944,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C544BE60002E002E002E000AC0ACC2E4C7400020BD80C790C7780020AC700020C544B2C8C57C003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "뭐든지 주문해도 괜찮다면...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n아쥐르만산\n야돈의 꼬리를 사용한 브라치올레.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n엑스트라 버진 오랭열매 오일을\n잔뜩 바르는 오컬트소녀를<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n불안하게 바라보던 고오스가<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n야파열매 푸실리의 준비를 깜박한 요리.<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n이걸로 할게요.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 10,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 988,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 134
    },
    {
      "displayText": "왜 이렇게 씀씀이가 좋아졌지...\nZA로열에서 많이 버셨나?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1256,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C65C0020C774B807AC8C0020C500C500C774AC000020C88BC544C84CC9C0002E002E002E000A005A0041B85CC5F4C5D0C11C0020B9CEC7740020BC84C168B098003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "사양하지 말고\n뭐든지 주문하렴",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1324,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C0ACC591D558C9C00020B9D0ACE0000ABB50B4E0C9C00020C8FCBB38D558B8340000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "좋은 포켓몬 승부를 보면\n요리가 더 맛있어지니까요",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1360,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C88BC7400020D3ECCF13BAAC0020C2B9BD80B97C0020BCF4BA74000AC694B9ACAC000020B3540020B9DBC788C5B4C9C0B2C8AE4CC6940000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "포켓몬의 진지함이야말로\n최고의 조미료 아닐까요?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1416,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D3ECCF13BAACC7580020C9C4C9C0D568C774C57CB9D0B85C000ACD5CACE0C7580020C870BBF8B8CC0020C544B2D0AE4CC694003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "물론이죠! 오늘은 할머니와 손자가 아니라\n어른 대 어른으로 식사하러 온 거예요.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1472,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BB3CB860C774C8E000210020C624B298C7400020D560BA38B2C8C6400020C190C790AC000020C544B2C8B77C000AC5B4B9780020B3000020C5B4B978C73CB85C0020C2DDC0ACD558B7EC0020C6280020AC70C608C694002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "나는 혼자서도 즐겁게 지내고 있으니\n너무 마음 쓰지 말려무나.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1564,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B098B2940020D63CC790C11CB3C40020C990AC81AC8C0020C9C0B0B4ACE00020C788C73CB2C8000AB108BB340020B9C8C74C0020C4F0C9C00020B9D0B824BB34B098002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "기척을 숨기고 있으면\n아무도 말을 걸지 않겠지...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1636,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AE30CC99C7440020C228AE30ACE00020C788C73CBA74000AC544BB34B3C40020B9D0C7440020AC78C9C00020C54AACA0C9C0002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "당신은 진심으로\n식사 시간이 즐거운가 보오",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1696,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B2F9C2E0C7400020C9C4C2ECC73CB85C000AC2DDC0AC0020C2DCAC04C7740020C990AC70C6B4AC000020BCF4C6240000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "천천히 먹으면\n포만감이 채워지는 기분이거든",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1744,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "CC9CCC9CD7880020BA39C73CBA74000AD3ECB9CCAC10C7740020CC44C6CCC9C0B2940020AE30BD84C774AC70B4E00000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "제 나룸퍼프가\n더 귀여워요!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1792,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C81C0020B098B8F8D37CD504AC00000AB3540020ADC0C5ECC6CCC69400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "제 프레프티르가\n훨씬 더 차밍하거든요!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1824,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C81C0020D504B808D504D2F0B974AC00000AD6E8C52C0020B3540020CC28BC0DD558AC70B4E0C69400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "역시 이류의 고기 요리는\n최고라니까!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1868,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5EDC2DC0020C774B958C7580020ACE0AE300020C694B9ACB294000ACD5CACE0B77CB2C8AE4C00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "요리사 알베르 씨,\n실력이 더 느셨네!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1912,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C694B9ACC0AC0020C54CBCA0B9740020C528002C000AC2E4B825C7740020B3540020B290C168B12400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "조금 과소비하긴 했지만\n열심히 했으니 괜찮겠지?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1956,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C870AE080020ACFCC18CBE44D558AE340020D588C9C0B9CC000AC5F4C2ECD7880020D588C73CB2C80020AD1CCC2EACA0C9C0003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "또 오고 싶게 만드는 것이\n웨이터의 올바른 마음가짐이죠",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 2012,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B6100020C624ACE00020C2F6AC8C0020B9CCB4DCB2940020AC83C774000AC6E8C774D130C7580020C62CBC14B9780020B9C8C74CAC00C9D0C774C8E00000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    }
